---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; const entries=await getCollection('research',({data})=>!data.draft);
---
<BaseLayout title="Research & Learning" description="Current research interests in carbon methodologies, geospatial environmental risk, biodiversity and circularity."><header class="page-intro container"><span class="eyebrow">Research & learning</span><h1>Questions I am currently exploring.</h1><p>These are research interests and active learning directions. They are presented as work in progress, not as completed findings.</p></header><section class="section"><div class="container research-list">{entries.map((entry,i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h2>{entry.data.title}</h2><p>{entry.data.description}</p></div></article>)}</div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.research-list>article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 7fr;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0}.research-list span{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}.research-list h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,3.5rem)}article p{color:var(--muted);max-width:65ch;margin-top:10px}@media(max-width:600px){.research-list>article{grid-template-columns:35px 1fr}}</style>
